<%# Terminal replacement for a login attempt whose row is gone (pruned, or
    cascaded away with a deleted account). Deliberately carries no
    quotas-login-poller controller, so swapping this in stops the poll. %>
<div class="rounded-md bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 p-3">
  <p class="text-xs text-amber-800">
    This login is no longer being tracked — its record was removed while it was in
    flight. Reload the page to see the account's current state, then authenticate
    again if it still needs credentials.
  </p>
</div>
